			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761200101,
					"content": "…来，给你，这样我的部分就可以了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200102,
					"content": "哇！是画板！这么看来，难道说…！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200103,
					"content": "嗯，你们来得正好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200104,
					"content": "~！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200105,
					"content": "是梅拉大画家！好久不见了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200106,
					"content": "来得正好指的是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761200107,
					"content": "我刚刚带梅拉去了一趟月球。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200108,
					"content": "真羡慕你说这话的语气…轻松得就像说去隔壁花园逛了一圈一样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200109,
					"content": "不过，你们去月球做什么呀？去采风吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200110,
					"content": "对了一半。我们还在月球上，选好了办「画展」的地方，你们记得的吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200111,
					"content": "哦！记得记得，大画家梅拉的月神主题展！到时候可一定要叫我们去啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200112,
					"content": "嗯，当然。另外，梅拉这孩子，好像能体察到周围一些很细微的变化。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200113,
					"content": "它说我从月球上回来之后，很明显变了不少。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200114,
					"content": "所以想让我带它去看看，月球上到底有什么特殊的东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200115,
					"content": "哦！不愧是大艺术家…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200116,
					"content": "所以特殊的东西是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761200117,
					"content": "我也不知道，我带梅拉逛了好多地方，它好像都不满意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200118,
					"content": "直到，我带它去了你的飞船附近。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200119,
						761200120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200119,
					"content": "飞船？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761200121,
					"content": "不过我带它走近一些后，却发现它感兴趣的并不是飞船。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200122,
					"content": "嗯？那是什么呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200123,
					"content": "~！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200124,
					"content": "嗯？它在绕着哥伦比娅你飞欸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200125,
					"content": "哈哈，在那时它就这样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200126,
					"content": "我想，它真正感兴趣的，是我看到飞船后的样子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200127,
					"content": "你的…样子？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200128,
					"content": "#嗯，我想起了和{NICKNAME}一起来到这里时的情景。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200129,
					"content": "#我们坐在船上，望着提瓦特。{M#他}{F#她}找到了过去的真相，而我找到了自己的「家」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200130,
					"content": "仅仅只是回忆起这些，我就有了一种安心，或说，幸福的感觉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200131,
					"content": "~！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200132,
					"content": "嗯，你说得没错，这是我以前基本不曾有过的感受。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200133,
					"content": "所以，我就把我们的故事，包括和你上月球后发生的事告诉了梅拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200134,
					"content": "它听完后看起来很满意，像是找到了自己想要的灵感。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200135,
					"content": "原来是这样，那现在就是大画家梅拉动笔的阶段了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200136,
					"content": "你们当时没带我上去，我也很好奇梅拉到底会画出怎样的风景呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200137,
					"content": "这次需要什么来做颜料？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200138
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761200138,
					"content": "这次的有些特殊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200139,
					"content": "~！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200140,
					"content": "梅拉说，它想要只属于我们自己的颜料。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200141,
					"content": "欸？这是什么意思？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200142,
					"content": "大概就是…当你看到这个东西的时候，就会想起这段旅程，心中浮现起它带给你的收获与欢喜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200143
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200143,
					"content": "不用担心，梅拉只是想看看那东西，感受一下而已。不会用这么珍贵的东西来做颜料的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200144
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200144,
					"content": "哥伦比娅给了什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200145
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761200145,
					"content": "月球的土壤，还有你们送给我的祈月之夜贺卡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200146,
					"content": "#哦~总之就是能代表这次冒险的东西吧？那就交给{NICKNAME}来选了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200120,
					"content": "那倒的确有些特殊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200121
					]
				}
			]
		},
