				},
				{
					"id": 761200303,
					"content": "它看起来很满意呢，已经开始画起来了欸！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200304,
					"content": "这么一想，梅拉的这些画，简直囊括了哥伦比娅从诞生到现在的故事呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200305,
					"content": "故事还不会结束。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761200306,
					"content": "嗯！我也还没看够这位大画家的作品呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200307,
					"content": "！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200308,
					"content": "哦！画好了吗？你的速度真是一如既往地快呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200309,
					"content": "我看看…哇！好漂亮！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200310,
					"content": "原来在月球上看提瓦特，是这么美的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200311,
					"content": "哈…我现在能明白，为什么梅拉会说我变得不同了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200312,
					"content": "嗯？为什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200313,
					"content": "看到这幅画后，我想起来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200314,
					"content": "当时的我坐在月球上看着提瓦特，心里在想——以前的我，一直都在寻找属于自己的「家」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200315,
					"content": "但现在，我忽然有了两个「家」。而且它们都如此美丽。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200316,
					"content": "那时我明白了，或许「家」是你珍视的东西、珍视的「家人」和朋友们所在的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200317,
					"content": "不错的感想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200318
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 761200318,
					"content": "谢谢你，这之后，我想经常带月灵们去月亮上玩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761200319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761200319,
					"content": "也欢迎你们，以后一起去我的「另一个家」看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				}
			]
